1
00:00:00,869 --> 00:00:02,547
The Car Trip by Ruth Donnelly
露丝·唐纳利的汽车之旅

2
00:00:04,831 --> 00:00:07,187
we are going  on a trip
我们要去旅行

3
00:00:08,711 --> 00:00:10,307
Not on a plane!
不是在飞机上！

4
00:00:11,631 --> 00:00:13,307
Not in a ship!
不是在船上！

5
00:00:14,391 --> 00:00:17,187
We will ride in our new car
我们将乘坐我们的新车

6
00:00:18,871 --> 00:00:22,867
Buckle up -- we will go far
系好安全带我们会走得更远

7
00:00:24,992 --> 00:00:27,189
Red light stop
红灯停止

8
00:00:27,992 --> 00:00:29,946
Green light, go
绿灯，走

9
00:00:31,192 --> 00:00:34,987
Yellow light means slow, slow slow
黄灯表示慢，慢，慢

10
00:00:36,832 --> 00:00:39,546
Baby brother starts to fret
小弟弟开始烦恼

11
00:00:40,871 --> 00:00:45,087
Sister says,"Are we there yet?
姐姐说：“我们到了吗？

12
00:00:45,087 --> 00:00:45,637
"
"

13
00:00:47,832 --> 00:00:49,529
Quite now
相当现在

14
00:00:50,072 --> 00:00:52,106
Don't make a peep
别偷看

15
00:00:53,752 --> 00:00:57,186
Baby brother's  fast asleep
小弟弟睡着了

16
00:00:58,792 --> 00:01:02,506
I'm as quite as a mouse ...
我像老鼠一样安静…

17
00:01:04,552 --> 00:01:10,307
And here we are --at Grandma's house！
我们到了——在奶奶家！

